rem Exploring Strings for which Only One
rem Character Comes Lexicographically
rem After its Neighbour to the Left
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=158
rem Find the largest count p(n) of such
rem strings of n distinct letters

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option Letters integer = 26

rem Choose the n letters, then arrange
rem them with exactly one descent: the
rem Eulerian number 2^n - n - 1.
N = 2 to Letters array
Sets' = Letters N binomial
Ways' = 2 ** N - N - 1
Counts' = Sets * Ways
Answer = Counts max
Answer print
